    <p>
      Hi, I&rsquo;m <strong>Karim</strong> &mdash; a Computer Science student at IIT (Côte d&rsquo;Ivoire)
      and an aspiring <strong>AI, Data &amp; Robotics Engineer</strong>.
    </p>

    <p>
      This blog is my public engineering notebook. Inspired by the simplicity of
      <a href="https://karpathy.github.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Andrej Karpathy&rsquo;s blog</a>
      and the modern developer craft of
      <a href="https://codelynx.dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Codelynx</a>,
