      <li><strong>Data &amp; Python / TypeScript</strong> &mdash; pipelines, scraping, SQLite/Postgres, and modern web tooling.</li>
      <li><strong>Student-to-Engineer Journey</strong> &mdash; lessons learned building real systems from scratch.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>À propos (FR)</h2>
